WEBVTT

00:00:04.301 --> 00:00:06.624
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Most shops sell online,

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:11.542
and a lot of people go to the website rather than the actual shop.

00:00:12.504 --> 00:00:18.036
Since the Covid-19 pandemic, shopping online is even more popular.

00:00:19.322 --> 00:00:23.791
The first time you use a website, you can create an account

00:00:24.177 --> 00:00:30.207
where you give your personal details and choose a password for next time you shop.

00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:36.259
Or if you don’t want to do this, you can usually shop as a guest.

00:00:37.302 --> 00:00:39.435
You choose what you want to buy

00:00:39.802 --> 00:00:43.154
and click on the item to add it to your basket.

00:00:44.075 --> 00:00:46.946
When you are ready to pay, you click on

00:00:47.251 --> 00:00:48.849
‘continue to checkout’.

00:00:49.827 --> 00:00:53.820
You give the delivery address where you want them to send your things.

00:00:54.706 --> 00:00:58.361
You usually pay extra for next-day delivery –

00:00:58.932 --> 00:01:01.532
standard delivery is sometimes free.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:05.901
Then you review your order to check it is correct.

00:01:06.964 --> 00:01:10.572
You choose how you want to pay, for example,

00:01:10.573 --> 00:01:14.067
with a bank card, and give your card details,

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:16.796
that is, the number and expiry date.

00:01:17.711 --> 00:01:20.176
Finally, you place your order

00:01:20.409 --> 00:01:24.557
and receive a reference number and a confirmation email.

00:01:25.139 --> 00:01:26.749
And then you wait.